---
---

<header class="hero">
  <svg
    class="hero-sigil"
    viewBox="0 0 600 600"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <defs>
      <pattern
        id="sigilHatch"
        patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        width="4"
        height="4"
        patternTransform="rotate(45)"
      >
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="4" stroke="#14110d" stroke-width="0.6"></line>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <g fill="none" stroke="#14110d" stroke-width="1.2">
      <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="290"></circle>
      <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="260"></circle>
      <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="180"></circle>
      <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="110"></circle>
    </g>
    <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="60" fill="url(#sigilHatch)"></circle>
    <g stroke="#14110d" stroke-width="1.2">
      <line x1="300" y1="10" x2="300" y2="60"></line>
      <line x1="300" y1="540" x2="300" y2="590"></line>
      <line x1="10" y1="300" x2="60" y2="300"></line>
      <line x1="540" y1="300" x2="590" y2="300"></line>
    </g>
    <g fill="#b8341c">
      <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="8"></circle>
    </g>
    <text
      x="300"
      y="230"
      text-anchor="middle"
      font-family="Newsreader, serif"
      font-style="italic"
      font-size="18"
      fill="#14110d">sightless</text>
    <text
      x="300"
      y="380"
      text-anchor="middle"
      font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace"
      font-size="11"
      letter-spacing="4"
      fill="#14110d">v0.1 · DRAFT</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>Sightless Protocol — Specification</span>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <span>An open standard · Apache 2.0 · Pre-audit</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>
          Compute<br />
          <span class="italic">without</span> seeing.<br />
          <span class="small">Prove it. Verifiably. Offline. Forever.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-tagline">
          Sightless is the open protocol for <em>verifiable private compute</em>
          — backend-agnostic across FHE, TEE, MPC and ZK, with portable
          cryptographic Receipts any third party can validate.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#abstract">
            Read the spec
            <span class="btn-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/">
            crates/ source
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-aside">
        <dl>
          <dt>Author</dt><dd>Pierre Malherbe</dd>
          <dt>Version</dt><dd>v0.1 (DRAFT)</dd>
          <dt>Status</dt><dd>Experimental research</dd>
          <dt>License</dt><dd>Apache 2.0</dd>
          <dt>Audit</dt><dd>Pre-audit</dd>
          <dt>Backend</dt><dd>TFHE / tfhe-rs</dd>
          <dt>Envelope</dt><dd>Ed25519 · JCS · SHA-256</dd>
          <dt>Reference</dt><dd>Rust, crates/</dd>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
